  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:125px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Abazabbadon.jpg\" title=\" -- Don \"><img alt=\" -- Don \" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"264\" src=\"/images/Abazabbadon.jpg\" width=\"123\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Abazabbadon.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div><b> -- Don </b></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:202px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Donna.jpg\" title=\"-- Donna\"><img alt=\"-- Donna\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"218\" src=\"/images/Donna.jpg\" width=\"200\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Donna.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div><b>-- Donna</b></div></div></div>\n<p>Many of the Storerooms located off of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Embercore_Path\" title=\"The Embercore Path\">The Embercore Path</a> contain Candy Fabricator Machines guarded by <a href=\"/wiki/Abba_Labba\" title=\"Abba Labba\">Abba Labbas</a> and a <a href=\"/wiki/Candy_Golem\" title=\"Candy Golem\">Candy Golem</a> and led by one of Abaddon's brothers or sisters.  They are:\n</p>\n<table>\n<tr>\n<td>Storeroom 1A\n</td><td> Abazabbadon\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Storeroom 3A\n</td><td> Abadabbadoodon\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Storeroom 4A\n</td><td> Abracadabradonna\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Storeroom 5A\n</td><td>Abadunkadunkadonna\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Storeroom 7A\n</td><td> Abadumdadumdumdon\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Storeroom 7B\n</td><td> Abadupercalifragilisticexpialidonna\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p>They are usually accompanied by <a href=\"/wiki/Abba_Labba\" title=\"Abba Labba\">Abba Labbas</a> and a <a href=\"/wiki/Candy_Golem\" title=\"Candy Golem\">Candy Golem</a>.  -Don has good knockback, and -Donna fires Candy Craniums, but neither one is particularly hard to defeat.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
}
